#: templates/faq.html:46
msgid "1. How do I sign in and manage my account profile?"
msgstr "1. Bagaimana cara masuk dan mengelola profil akun saya?"

#: templates/faq.html:51
msgid ""
"You can sign in with your registered <b>Username</b> or <b>Email</b> plus"
" your password through the Sign In button in the navbar/sidebar. Once "
"you're in, head to <b>Profile Settings</b> to update your full name, "
"email, change your profile picture, and change your password whenever you"
" want."
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa masuk dengan <b>Username</b> atau <b>Email</b> terdaftar "
"beserta password kamu melalui tombol Masuk di navbar/sidebar. Setelah "
"masuk, buka <b>Pengaturan Profil</b> untuk memperbarui nama lengkap, "
"email, mengganti foto profil, dan mengubah password kapan saja."

#: templates/faq.html:60
msgid "2. What metrics or task categories show up on the Dashboard?"
msgstr "2. Metrik atau kategori task apa saja yang muncul di Dashboard?"

#: templates/faq.html:65
msgid ""
"The Dashboard shows a real-time summary straight from the database, "
"broken down by these quality categories:"
msgstr ""
"Dashboard menampilkan ringkasan real-time langsung dari database, dibagi "
"berdasarkan kategori kualitas berikut:"

#: templates/faq.html:67
msgid "Need Sample:"
msgstr "Butuh Sampel:"

#: templates/faq.html:67
msgid "New tasks that still need a test sample."
msgstr "Task baru yang masih butuh sampel uji."

#: templates/faq.html:68
msgid "Sample Done:"
msgstr "Sampel Selesai:"

#: templates/faq.html:68
msgid "Tasks whose sample work is already finished."
msgstr "Task yang pekerjaan sampelnya sudah selesai."

#: templates/faq.html:69
msgid "Revision:"
msgstr "Revisi:"

#: templates/faq.html:69
msgid "Tasks that need fixes or another pass."
msgstr "Task yang butuh perbaikan atau pengecekan ulang."

#: templates/faq.html:70
msgid "Ready:"
msgstr "Siap:"

#: templates/faq.html:70
msgid "Tasks that got approved (Passed) and are good to go for production."
msgstr "Task yang sudah disetujui (Lulus) dan siap dikirim ke produksi."

#: templates/faq.html:71
msgid "Skipped:"
msgstr "Dilewati:"

#: templates/faq.html:71
msgid "Tasks marked to be skipped this round."
msgstr "Task yang ditandai untuk dilewati pada ronde ini."

#: templates/faq.html:81
msgid "3. How do I manage projects and sync up task data?"
msgstr "3. Bagaimana cara mengelola proyek dan menyinkronkan data task?"

#: templates/faq.html:86
msgid ""
"From the <b>Task Management</b> menu, users with <b>Developer</b> or "
"<b>Quality Control</b> access can upload project data files in <b>Excel "
"(.xlsx, .xls)</b> or <b>CSV</b> format. The system will auto-sync the "
"task data into the database. You can also filter data, search by keyword,"
" update task status/notes, forward tasks to the production team, or "
"permanently delete a whole project."
msgstr ""
"Dari menu <b>Manajemen Task</b>, pengguna dengan akses <b>Developer</b> "
"atau <b>Quality Control</b> bisa mengupload file data proyek berformat "
"<b>Excel (.xlsx, .xls)</b> atau <b>CSV</b>. Sistem akan otomatis "
"menyinkronkan data task ke database. Kamu juga bisa memfilter data, "
"mencari berdasarkan kata kunci, memperbarui status/catatan task, "
"meneruskan task ke tim produksi, atau menghapus seluruh proyek secara "
"permanen."

#: templates/faq.html:95
msgid "4. What's the QR Management menu for?"
msgstr "4. Untuk apa menu Manajemen QR?"

#: templates/faq.html:100
msgid ""
"The <b>QR Management</b> menu is where Developers and Quality Control "
"folks upload reference documents in <b>PDF</b> format. Users can open "
"those docs right in a clean pop-up (Modal) viewer with no extra toolbar "
"clutter, which makes it way easier to review stuff out in the field."
msgstr ""
"Menu <b>Manajemen QR</b> adalah tempat Developer dan Quality Control "
"mengupload dokumen referensi berformat <b>PDF</b>. Pengguna bisa membuka "
"dokumen tersebut langsung di tampilan pop-up (Modal) yang bersih tanpa "
"gangguan toolbar ekstra, sehingga lebih mudah mereview pekerjaan di "
"lapangan."

#: templates/faq.html:109
msgid "5. What are the different access levels (Roles) in this system?"
msgstr "5. Apa saja tingkat akses (Role) yang ada di sistem ini?"

#: templates/faq.html:114
msgid "The system runs on Role-Based Access Control:"
msgstr ""
"Sistem ini berjalan menggunakan Kontrol Akses Berbasis Role (Role-Based "
"Access Control):"

#: templates/faq.html:116
msgid "Developer:"
msgstr "Developer:"

#: templates/faq.html:116
msgid ""
"Top-level access — covers user management, system settings, support "
"tickets, plus full control over tasks and documents."
msgstr ""
"Akses tingkat atas — mencakup manajemen user, pengaturan sistem, tiket "
"support, serta kontrol penuh atas task dan dokumen."

#: templates/faq.html:117
msgid "Quality Control:"
msgstr "Quality Control:"

#: templates/faq.html:117
msgid ""
"Full access to import project data, evaluate tasks, change QC status, and"
" manage PDF documents."
msgstr ""
"Akses penuh untuk mengimpor data proyek, mengevaluasi task, mengubah "
"status QC, dan mengelola dokumen PDF."

#: templates/faq.html:118
msgid "Supervisor:"
msgstr "Supervisor:"

#: templates/faq.html:118
msgid ""
"Can view the dashboard, filter tasks, and forward tasks to the production"
" team."
msgstr ""
"Dapat melihat dashboard, memfilter task, dan meneruskan task ke tim "
"produksi."

#: templates/faq.html:119
msgid "Public (Guest):"
msgstr "Public (Tamu):"

#: templates/faq.html:119
msgid ""
"Regular visitors who can only see the dashboard summary and the list of "
"tasks already sent to production."
msgstr ""
"Pengunjung biasa yang hanya bisa melihat ringkasan dashboard dan daftar "
"task yang sudah dikirim ke produksi."

#: templates/faq.html:130
msgid "6. What if I run into an issue or need tech support?"
msgstr "6. Bagaimana jika saya mengalami kendala atau butuh dukungan teknis?"

#: templates/faq.html:135
msgid ""
"Head over to the <b>Customer Service</b> menu to send in a message about "
"any issue or bug straight to the engineering team. If you're a "
"<b>Developer</b>, you can check every incoming message through the "
"dedicated <b>Support Tickets</b> menu."
msgstr ""
"Kunjungi menu <b>Layanan Pelanggan</b> untuk mengirimkan pesan mengenai "
"masalah atau laporan bug langsung ke tim engineering. Jika kamu seorang "
"<b>Developer</b>, kamu bisa mengecek setiap pesan masuk melalui menu "
"khusus <b>Tiket Support</b>."

#: templates/faq.html:144
msgid "7. How do I search for and sort specific tasks?"
msgstr "7. Bagaimana cara mencari dan mengurutkan task tertentu?"

#: templates/faq.html:149
msgid ""
"Use the <b>Search</b> box to find tasks by ID, name, or description "
"instantly. For more sorting options, hit the <b>Sort Data</b> button (top"
" right corner) to filter by a specific Project or Package. If nothing "
"shows up, double-check that a filter isn't already active."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan kolom <b>Pencarian</b> untuk menemukan task berdasarkan ID, nama,"
" atau deskripsi secara instan. Untuk opsi pengurutan lebih lanjut, tekan "
"tombol <b>Urutkan Data</b> (sudut kanan atas) untuk memfilter berdasarkan"
" Proyek atau Paket tertentu. Jika tidak ada yang muncul, pastikan filter "
"tidak sedang aktif."

#: templates/faq.html:159
msgid "8. Why does the data keep refreshing on its own?"
msgstr "8. Mengapa data terus melakukan refresh sendiri?"

#: templates/faq.html:164
msgid ""
"We've got a <b>Real-time Auto-Update</b> feature built in. The app checks"
" the database for changes every 5 seconds. That way, any status change "
"made by the QC team shows up instantly for Leaders and other users "
"without anyone needing to manually refresh the page."
msgstr ""
"Kami memiliki fitur <b>Auto-Update Real-time</b> yang tertanam di sistem."
" Aplikasi mengecek perubahan database setiap 5 detik. Dengan begitu, "
"setiap perubahan status oleh tim QC akan langsung tampil untuk Leader dan"
" pengguna lain tanpa perlu merefresh halaman secara manual."

